    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-20a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20A Restraining orders—unexplained wealth",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-20a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "When a restraining order must be made\n\n(1) A court with *proceeds jurisdiction may order that:\n\n(a) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person; or\n\n(b) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person except in the manner and circumstances specified\nin the order;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth",
      "skos:definition": "When a restraining order must be made\n\n(1) A court with *proceeds jurisdiction may order that:\n\n(a) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person; or\n\n(b) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person except in the manner and circumstances specified\nin the order;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-20a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-20a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6237ba3de4df5068cea935cb2b48c0a17f346c356abc5537bfd872745b553f9d",
      "skos:note": "Restrict property disposal or handling without court order"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-20a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20A Restraining orders—unexplained wealth",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "When a restraining order must be made\n\n(1) A court with *proceeds jurisdiction may order that:\n\n(a) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person; or\n\n(b) property must not be disposed of or otherwise dealt with by\nany person except in the manner and circumstances specified\nin the order;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-20a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
