      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "(3A) Without limiting the manner and circumstances that may be\nspecified in an order under paragraph (1)(b), the court may order\nthat specified property may be disposed of or otherwise dealt with\nfor the purposes of meeting a person’s reasonable legal expenses\narising from an application under this Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(3A) Without limiting the manner and circumstances that may be\nspecified in an order under paragraph (1)(b), the court may order\nthat specified property may be disposed of or otherwise dealt with\nfor the purposes of meeting a person’s reasonable legal expenses\narising from an application under this Act.",
