      "values:originalText": "(4A) If the court refuses to make a *restraining order under\nsubsection (1), it may make any order as to costs it considers\nappropriate, including costs on an indemnity basis.\nRisk of property being disposed of etc.",
      "skos:definition": "(4A) If the court refuses to make a *restraining order under\nsubsection (1), it may make any order as to costs it considers\nappropriate, including costs on an indemnity basis.\nRisk of property being disposed of etc.",
