    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "179J Reducing unexplained wealth amounts to take account of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179j"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "forfeiture, pecuniary penalties etc.\n\nIn determining the *unexplained wealth amount specified in an\n*unexplained wealth order in relation to a person, the court must\ndeduct an amount equal to the following:\n\n(a) the value, at the time of making the order, of any property of\nthe person forfeited under:\n\n(i) a *forfeiture order; or\n\n(ii) an *interstate forfeiture order; or\n\n(iii) a *foreign forfeiture order;\n\n(b) the sum of any amounts payable by the person under:\n\n(i) a *pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(ii) a *literary proceeds order; or\n\n(iii) an order under section 243B of the Customs Act 1901;\nor\n\n(iv) an *interstate pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(v) a *foreign pecuniary penalty order.",
      "skos:definition": "forfeiture, pecuniary penalties etc.\n\nIn determining the *unexplained wealth amount specified in an\n*unexplained wealth order in relation to a person, the court must\ndeduct an amount equal to the following:\n\n(a) the value, at the time of making the order, of any property of\nthe person forfeited under:\n\n(i) a *forfeiture order; or\n\n(ii) an *interstate forfeiture order; or\n\n(iii) a *foreign forfeiture order;\n\n(b) the sum of any amounts payable by the person under:\n\n(i) a *pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(ii) a *literary proceeds order; or\n\n(iii) an order under section 243B of the Customs Act 1901;\nor\n\n(iv) an *interstate pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(v) a *foreign pecuniary penalty order.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179j-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e1194f6f13db0bfbbf2607dd2358cad10ab2cad4ed14b643570b0c2aa6570d5",
      "skos:note": "Deduct unexplained wealth amounts from a person's total wealth when determining an unexplained wealth order."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179j",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "179J Reducing unexplained wealth amounts to take account of",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "forfeiture, pecuniary penalties etc.\n\nIn determining the *unexplained wealth amount specified in an\n*unexplained wealth order in relation to a person, the court must\ndeduct an amount equal to the following:\n\n(a) the value, at the time of making the order, of any property of\nthe person forfeited under:\n\n(i) a *forfeiture order; or\n\n(ii) an *interstate forfeiture order; or\n\n(iii) a *foreign forfeiture order;\n\n(b) the sum of any amounts payable by the person under:\n\n(i) a *pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(ii) a *literary proceeds order; or\n\n(iii) an order under section 243B of the Customs Act 1901;\nor\n\n(iv) an *interstate pecuniary penalty order; or\n\n(v) a *foreign pecuniary penalty order."
    },
    {
