    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179n",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "179N Notice of application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179n"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section sets out the notice requirements if the *DPP has made\nan application for an *unexplained wealth order.\n\n(2) If a court with *proceeds jurisdiction makes a *preliminary\nunexplained wealth order in relation to the person, the *DPP must,\nwithin 7 days of the making of the order:\n\n(a) give written notice of the order to the person who would be\nsubject to the *unexplained wealth order if it were made; and\n\n(b) provide to the person a copy of the application for the\nunexplained wealth order, and the affidavit referred to in\nsubsection 179B(2).\n\n(3) The *DPP must also give a copy of any other affidavit supporting\nthe application to the person who would be subject to the\n*unexplained wealth order if it were made.\n\n(4) The copies must be given under subsection (3) within a reasonable\ntime before the hearing in relation to whether the order is to be\nmade.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section sets out the notice requirements if the *DPP has made\nan application for an *unexplained wealth order.\n\n(2) If a court with *proceeds jurisdiction makes a *preliminary\nunexplained wealth order in relation to the person, the *DPP must,\nwithin 7 days of the making of the order:\n\n(a) give written notice of the order to the person who would be\nsubject to the *unexplained wealth order if it were made; and\n\n(b) provide to the person a copy of the application for the\nunexplained wealth order, and the affidavit referred to in\nsubsection 179B(2).\n\n(3) The *DPP must also give a copy of any other affidavit supporting\nthe application to the person who would be subject to the\n*unexplained wealth order if it were made.\n\n(4) The copies must be given under subsection (3) within a reasonable\ntime before the hearing in relation to whether the order is to be\nmade.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179n-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179n-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179n-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179n-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c506acae73f3173882db5d2458a4accbbf8abb7b4bc55e760e8d1acf0ea49633"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179n",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "179N Notice of application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section sets out the notice requirements if the *DPP has made\nan application for an *unexplained wealth order.\n\n(2) If a court with *proceeds jurisdiction makes a *preliminary\nunexplained wealth order in relation to the person, the *DPP must,\nwithin 7 days of the making of the order:\n\n(a) give written notice of the order to the person who would be\nsubject to the *unexplained wealth order if it were made; and\n\n(b) provide to the person a copy of the application for the\nunexplained wealth order, and the affidavit referred to in\nsubsection 179B(2).\n\n(3) The *DPP must also give a copy of any other affidavit supporting\nthe application to the person who would be subject to the\n*unexplained wealth order if it were made.\n\n(4) The copies must be given under subsection (3) within a reasonable\ntime before the hearing in relation to whether the order is to be\nmade."
    },
