    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179p-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "179P(1) Additional application for an unexplained wealth order",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The *DPP cannot, unless the court gives leave, apply for an\n*unexplained wealth order against a person if:\n\n(a) an application has previously been made for an unexplained\nwealth order in relation to the person; and\n\n(b) the application has been finally determined on the merits."
    },
