      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.21",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is subject to an *unexplained wealth order; and\n\n(b) the *DPP applies to the court for an order under this section;\nand\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is subject to an *unexplained wealth order; and\n\n(b) the *DPP applies to the court for an order under this section;\nand\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth",
      "cml:asserts": [
