    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-1-sec-179s",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "179S Property subject to a person’s effective control",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 21,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n\n(a) a person is subject to an *unexplained wealth order; and\n\n(b) the *DPP applies to the court for an order under this section;\nand\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 1  Unexplained wealth"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-1-sec-179s-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
