      "values:originalText": "(1) The operation of this Part and section 20A is subject to the\noversight of the Parliamentary Joint Committee on the Australian\nCrime Commission (the Committee).\n\n(2) The Committee may require the Australian Crime Commission, the\nAustralian Federal Police, the *DPP or any other federal agency or\nauthority that is the recipient of any material disclosed as the result\nof the operation of this Part to appear before it from time to time to\ngive evidence.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The operation of this Part and section 20A is subject to the\noversight of the Parliamentary Joint Committee on the Australian\nCrime Commission (the Committee).\n\n(2) The Committee may require the Australian Crime Commission, the\nAustralian Federal Police, the *DPP or any other federal agency or\nauthority that is the recipient of any material disclosed as the result\nof the operation of this Part to appear before it from time to time to\ngive evidence.",
