      "values:originalText": "means\n\n(1) An *authorised officer described in paragraph (a), (aa), (b) or (c) of\nthe definition of authorised officer in section 338 may apply to a\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime",
      "skos:definition": "means\n\n(1) An *authorised officer described in paragraph (a), (aa), (b) or (c) of\nthe definition of authorised officer in section 338 may apply to a\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime",
