      "values:originalText": "(2) If the magistrate makes the *freezing order, he or she must inform\nthe applicant, by telephone, fax or other electronic means, of the\nterms of the order and the day on which and the time at which it\nwas signed.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If the magistrate makes the *freezing order, he or she must inform\nthe applicant, by telephone, fax or other electronic means, of the\nterms of the order and the day on which and the time at which it\nwas signed.",
