    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-30-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30(4) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-2-sec-30-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.34",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The applicant must give the magistrate the form of *freezing order\ncompleted by the applicant by the end of:\n\n(a) the second *working day after the magistrate makes the\norder; or\n\n(b) the first working day after the magistrate makes the order, if\nit is served on the *financial institution concerned before the\nfirst working day after the magistrate makes the order.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The applicant must give the magistrate the form of *freezing order\ncompleted by the applicant by the end of:\n\n(a) the second *working day after the magistrate makes the\norder; or\n\n(b) the first working day after the magistrate makes the order, if\nit is served on the *financial institution concerned before the\nfirst working day after the magistrate makes the order.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-30"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
