      "values:originalText": "institution to meet its liabilities\n\nA *freezing order relating to an *account with a *financial\ninstitution does not prevent the institution from allowing a\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime"
