      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.46",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of section 116 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the\ncommencement of the amendments for a pecuniary penalty order,\nwhether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or\noccurs before, on or after that commencement.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of section 116 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to applications made on or after the\ncommencement of the amendments for a pecuniary penalty order,\nwhether the conduct constituting the offence concerned occurred or\noccurs before, on or after that commencement.",
