      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of section 202 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to production orders applied for on\nor after the commencement of the amendments, whether the conduct\nconstituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after\nthat commencement.",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of section 202 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to production orders applied for on\nor after the commencement of the amendments, whether the conduct\nconstituting the offence concerned occurred or occurs before, on or after\nthat commencement.",
