      "values:originalText": "The amendments of section 111 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to the quashing, on or after the\ncommencement of the amendments, of a conviction of an offence,\nwhether the conviction occurred before, on or after that commencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of section 111 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to the quashing, on or after the\ncommencement of the amendments, of a conviction of an offence,\nwhether the conviction occurred before, on or after that commencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-63-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-63-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-63-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f58b48d1bf1239abb646622acbe770516b02ba24e9e5359ed015877c36673c1",
      "skos:note": "Amendments of section 111 apply to quashing convictions on or after commencement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-2-sec-63",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "63 Application of amendments of section 111",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of section 111 of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002\nmade by this Part apply in relation to the quashing, on or after the\ncommencement of the amendments, of a conviction of an offence,\nwhether the conviction occurred before, on or after that commencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 2  Other amendments relating to proceeds of crime"
