      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if a person obtains information:\n\n(a) as a direct result of:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nOther amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2\nDisclosure of information  Part 4\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(i) the person being given a sworn statement under an order\nmade under paragraph 39(1)(d); or\n\n(ii) the exercise of a power (by the person or someone else),\nor performance (by the person) of a function, under",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if a person obtains information:\n\n(a) as a direct result of:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nOther amendments relating to proceeds of crime  Schedule 2\nDisclosure of information  Part 4\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(i) the person being given a sworn statement under an order\nmade under paragraph 39(1)(d); or\n\n(ii) the exercise of a power (by the person or someone else),\nor performance (by the person) of a function, under",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-266a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-2-sec-266a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "767c1bcbb95aecbbf658f8dd37d3740fa2e27d878c76890f9df46fc237e4bbfc",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of information required for obtaining a sworn statement under an order."
    },
    {
