    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ge",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15GE Meaning of serious Commonwealth offence and serious State",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ge"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "offence that has a federal aspect\nMeaning of serious Commonwealth offence\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, serious Commonwealth offence\nmeans a Commonwealth offence that:\n\n(a) involves a matter mentioned in subsection (2); and\n\n(b) is punishable on conviction by imprisonment for a period of\n3 years or more.\n\n(2) The matters are as follows:\n\n(a) theft;\n\n(b) fraud;\n\n(c) tax evasion;\n\n(d) currency violations;\n\n(e) controlled substances;\n\n(f) illegal gambling;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "skos:definition": "offence that has a federal aspect\nMeaning of serious Commonwealth offence\n\n(1) For the purposes of this Part, serious Commonwealth offence\nmeans a Commonwealth offence that:\n\n(a) involves a matter mentioned in subsection (2); and\n\n(b) is punishable on conviction by imprisonment for a period of\n3 years or more.\n\n(2) The matters are as follows:\n\n(a) theft;\n\n(b) fraud;\n\n(c) tax evasion;\n\n(d) currency violations;\n\n(e) controlled substances;\n\n(f) illegal gambling;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "cml:hasPart": [
