    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-70",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "70 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-70"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Nothing in this Part prevents an authority being granted in respect\nof a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous\nauthority, but in that case the subsequent authority must be a\nformal authority.\nNote:\nAn urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its\nduration—see sections 15GO and 15GS.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Nothing in this Part prevents an authority being granted in respect\nof a controlled operation that has been the subject of a previous\nauthority, but in that case the subsequent authority must be a\nformal authority.\nNote:\nAn urgent authority can be varied, but not so as to extend its\nduration—see sections 15GO and 15GS.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-70-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-70-logic-deontic-1"
        },
