      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(2) Nothing in this Part prevents an authority being granted...",
      "cml:conclusionText": "...but in that case the subsequent authority must be a formal authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-70-logic-deontic-4",
