    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15gn-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15GN(3) Commencement and duration of authorities",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 76,
      "values:originalText": "(3) An authority (whether formal or urgent) has effect for the period of\neffect specified in it under paragraph 15GK(1)(h) or (2)(h) unless:\n\n(a) it is cancelled before the end of the period of effect; or\n\n(b) in the case of a formal authority—the period of effect is\nextended under Subdivision B or C.\nSubdivision B—Variation of authorities by appropriate\nauthorising officers"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gn-ss-3-norm",
