    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15GP(5) Application to appropriate authorising officer",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The application (whether a formal variation application or an\nurgent variation application) must state whether or not the\ncontrolled operation has been the subject of an earlier urgent\nvariation application under this section and, if so:\n\n(a) whether the urgent variation application was the last\napplication under this section for a variation; and\n\n(b) whether or not the variation was granted.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The application (whether a formal variation application or an\nurgent variation application) must state whether or not the\ncontrolled operation has been the subject of an earlier urgent\nvariation application under this section and, if so:\n\n(a) whether the urgent variation application was the last\napplication under this section for a variation; and\n\n(b) whether or not the variation was granted.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gp"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2c66cf45cb019ba923e3d857ed10b6c568d6428b9cf20b506a23bf90159b5fdd",
      "skos:note": "Must state earlier urgent variation application details",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15gp-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15GP(5) Application to appropriate authorising officer",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 78,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The application (whether a formal variation application or an\nurgent variation application) must state whether or not the\ncontrolled operation has been the subject of an earlier urgent\nvariation application under this section and, if so:\n\n(a) whether the urgent variation application was the last\napplication under this section for a variation; and\n\n(b) whether or not the variation was granted."
    },
    {
