      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(7) The authorising officer to whom the application is made may\nrequire the applicant to provide such information concerning the\nproposed variation as is necessary for the authorising officer’s\nproper consideration of the application.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) The authorising officer to whom the application is made may\nrequire the applicant to provide such information concerning the\nproposed variation as is necessary for the authorising officer’s\nproper consideration of the application.",
      "values:partOf": {
