    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15gz-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15GZ(2) Effect of authorities",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15gz-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.87",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A person identified in an authority as being authorised to engage in\ncontrolled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation is\nauthorised to do so for the period of effect of the authority, unless:\n\n(a) the authority specifies a shorter period during which the\nperson is so authorised; or\n\n(b) the authority is varied to provide that the person is no longer\nso authorised; or\n\n(c) the authority is cancelled before the end of that period.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A person identified in an authority as being authorised to engage in\ncontrolled conduct for the purposes of the controlled operation is\nauthorised to do so for the period of effect of the authority, unless:\n\n(a) the authority specifies a shorter period during which the\nperson is so authorised; or\n\n(b) the authority is varied to provide that the person is no longer\nso authorised; or\n\n(c) the authority is cancelled before the end of that period.",
