      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(c) the conduct does not involve the participant intentionally\ninducing a person to commit a Commonwealth offence or an\noffence under a law of a State or Territory that the person\nwould not otherwise have intended to commit;",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The participant must not induce."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ha-ss-2-logic-deontic-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
