          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-94-ss-2b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "938c416bc7305e78b835498b9b0057e8de824c20781f65371ea95928e9ba0183",
      "skos:note": "Identify law enforcement agency or person with possession of narcotic goods.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-94-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "94(2B) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If the controlled operation involved narcotic goods that have not\nbeen destroyed, and the identity of the person who has possession\nof the narcotic goods is known, the report is to:\n\n(a) if the person is a law enforcement officer—identify the law\nenforcement agency of which the person is an officer; or\n\n(b) otherwise—identify the person."
    },
    {
