      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman must, as soon as practicable after 30 June in each\nyear:\n\n(a) prepare a report of the work and activities under this Part of\nthe Ombudsman for the preceding 12 months and give a copy\nof the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of the law\nenforcement agency to which the report relates; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the work and activities of the Ombudsman\nfor the preceding 12 months, being work or activities under a\ncorresponding State controlled operations law, and give a\ncopy of the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of\nthe ACC.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Ombudsman must, as soon as practicable after 30 June in each\nyear:\n\n(a) prepare a report of the work and activities under this Part of\nthe Ombudsman for the preceding 12 months and give a copy\nof the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of the law\nenforcement agency to which the report relates; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the work and activities of the Ombudsman\nfor the preceding 12 months, being work or activities under a\ncorresponding State controlled operations law, and give a\ncopy of the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of\nthe ACC.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ho"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ho-ss-1-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ho-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "168cd8d9cf268d382b49f444dd32d2ae865eaba95aaf03f7e34d86e014f33ef1",
      "skos:note": "The Ombudsman must prepare and provide reports to the Minister and ACC.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ho-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HO(1) Annual report by Ombudsman",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Ombudsman must, as soon as practicable after 30 June in each\nyear:\n\n(a) prepare a report of the work and activities under this Part of\nthe Ombudsman for the preceding 12 months and give a copy\nof the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of the law\nenforcement agency to which the report relates; and\n\n(b) prepare a report of the work and activities of the Ombudsman\nfor the preceding 12 months, being work or activities under a\ncorresponding State controlled operations law, and give a\ncopy of the report to the Minister and to the chief officer of\nthe ACC."
    },
