    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-98-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "98(7) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-98-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(7) If a report relates, in whole or in part, to the work or activities of\nthe ACC under a corresponding State controlled operations law,\nthe Minister must, as soon as practicable after the report is laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament, send a copy of the report to\nthe State or Territory Minister with responsibility for the\ncorresponding State controlled operations law.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) If a report relates, in whole or in part, to the work or activities of\nthe ACC under a corresponding State controlled operations law,\nthe Minister must, as soon as practicable after the report is laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament, send a copy of the report to\nthe State or Territory Minister with responsibility for the\ncorresponding State controlled operations law.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-98"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-98-ss-7-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-98-ss-7-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f69db0b3333f87f83091488cd7372fe6b33656a351196cdcad68a1edcd66e33a",
      "skos:note": "Must send copy of report to State or Territory Minister with responsibility for corresponding law."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-98-ss-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "98(7) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(7) If a report relates, in whole or in part, to the work or activities of\nthe ACC under a corresponding State controlled operations law,\nthe Minister must, as soon as practicable after the report is laid\nbefore each House of the Parliament, send a copy of the report to\nthe State or Territory Minister with responsibility for the\ncorresponding State controlled operations law."
    },
    {
