      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2a89aba8533be14705d084ae3ff0c9cf564054cbdbc5fbe3f9f5db03008152a0",
      "skos:note": "Law enforcement agencies and individuals must report possession of narcotic goods.",
      "dc:description": "Information about possession of narcotic goods"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100(2A) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(2A) If the controlled operation involved illicit goods that are narcotic\ngoods, the general register is to:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(a) identify each law enforcement agency an officer of which\nhad possession of the narcotic goods in the course of the\ncontrolled operation; and\n\n(b) identify to the extent known any other person who had\npossession of the narcotic goods in the course of the\ncontrolled operation; and\n\n(c) state whether the narcotic goods have been destroyed; and\n\n(d) if the narcotic goods have not been destroyed—contain the\ninformation specified in subsection (2B) relating to the\npossession of the narcotic goods, or state that it is not known\nwho has possession of them."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must report possession of narcotic goods",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "100(2B) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.104",
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If the controlled operation involved narcotic goods that have not\nbeen destroyed, and the identity of the person who has possession\nof the narcotic goods is known, the general register is to:\n\n(a) if the person is a law enforcement officer—identify the law\nenforcement agency of which the person is an officer; or\n\n(b) otherwise—identify the person.",
      "skos:definition": "(2B) If the controlled operation involved narcotic goods that have not\nbeen destroyed, and the identity of the person who has possession\nof the narcotic goods is known, the general register is to:\n\n(a) if the person is a law enforcement officer—identify the law\nenforcement agency of which the person is an officer; or\n\n(b) otherwise—identify the person.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "864a6221e39e31730ee8b097e1021bc21f8c049d8d5f547808d8cd82319c5bb8",
      "skos:note": "Identify the law enforcement agency of which the person is an officer if they are a law enforcement officer.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "100(2B) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 104,
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If the controlled operation involved narcotic goods that have not\nbeen destroyed, and the identity of the person who has possession\nof the narcotic goods is known, the general register is to:\n\n(a) if the person is a law enforcement officer—identify the law\nenforcement agency of which the person is an officer; or\n\n(b) otherwise—identify the person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-100-ss-2b-norm",
