      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "(5) Nothing in this section requires the Ombudsman to inspect records\nrelating to operations that have not been completed at the time of\nthe inspection.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "(5) Nothing in this section requires the Ombudsman to inspect records\nrelating to operations that have not been completed at the time of\nthe inspection.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010",
