      "values:originalText": "(5) The place, and the period or the time and day, specified in a\nrequirement under this section, must be reasonable having regard\nto the circumstances in which the requirement is made.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The place, and the period or the time and day, specified in a\nrequirement under this section, must be reasonable having regard\nto the circumstances in which the requirement is made.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
