      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(3) Nothing in section 15HK or 15HL or in any other law prevents an\nofficer of an agency from:\n\n(a) giving information to an inspecting officer (whether orally or\nin writing and whether or not in answer to a question); or\n\n(b) giving access to a record of the agency to an inspecting\nofficer;\nfor the purposes of an inspection under this Division of the\nagency’s records.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) Nothing in section 15HK or 15HL or in any other law prevents an\nofficer of an agency from:\n\n(a) giving information to an inspecting officer (whether orally or\nin writing and whether or not in answer to a question); or\n\n(b) giving access to a record of the agency to an inspecting\nofficer;\nfor the purposes of an inspection under this Division of the\nagency’s records.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hv"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
