        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3c35884dfae78914fa722e4ad234bb2e5ba62e20427facbc51194119efb260ad",
      "skos:note": "Agency must provide information and access to inspecting officer for inspection purposes."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15hv-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HV(3) Ombudsman to be given information and access despite other",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Nothing in section 15HK or 15HL or in any other law prevents an\nofficer of an agency from:\n\n(a) giving information to an inspecting officer (whether orally or\nin writing and whether or not in answer to a question); or\n\n(b) giving access to a record of the agency to an inspecting\nofficer;\nfor the purposes of an inspection under this Division of the\nagency’s records."
    },
