      "skos:note": "Agency officer must provide information to a person despite other laws.",
      "dc:description": "Information"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15hv-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HV(4) Ombudsman to be given information and access despite other",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 108,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Nothing in section 15HK or 15HL or in any other law prevents an\nofficer of an agency from making a record of information, or\ncausing a record of information to be made, for the purposes of\ngiving the information to a person as permitted by subsection (3)."
    },
