        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.110",
      "values:originalText": "A document purporting to be an authority granted under\nsection 15GI or under a corresponding State controlled operations\nlaw:\n\n(a) is admissible in any legal proceedings; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(b) in the absence of evidence to the contrary, is proof in any\nproceedings (not being criminal or disciplinary proceedings\nagainst a law enforcement officer) that the person granting\nthe authority was satisfied of the facts he or she was required\nto be satisfied of to grant the authority.",
      "skos:definition": "A document purporting to be an authority granted under\nsection 15GI or under a corresponding State controlled operations\nlaw:\n\n(a) is admissible in any legal proceedings; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(b) in the absence of evidence to the contrary, is proof in any\nproceedings (not being criminal or disciplinary proceedings\nagainst a law enforcement officer) that the person granting\nthe authority was satisfied of the facts he or she was required\nto be satisfied of to grant the authority.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hz-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hz-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6238cbec645ac1fe83fc7207039dd34d59e4859362f10279106e3e7492114ee2",
      "skos:note": "A document purporting to be an authority granted under section 15GI is admissible in any legal proceedings."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15hz",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15HZ Evidence of authorities",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 110,
      "values:originalText": "A document purporting to be an authority granted under\nsection 15GI or under a corresponding State controlled operations\nlaw:\n\n(a) is admissible in any legal proceedings; and\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nAmendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and witness identity\nprotection  Schedule 3\nMain amendments  Part 1\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\n\n(b) in the absence of evidence to the contrary, is proof in any\nproceedings (not being criminal or disciplinary proceedings\nagainst a law enforcement officer) that the person granting\nthe authority was satisfied of the facts he or she was required\nto be satisfied of to grant the authority."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15hz-norm",
