      "cof:title": "15K Definitions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection"
    },
