      "skos:note": "Acquire an assumed identity, means acquire evidence of the\nassumed identity and includes taking steps towards acquiring\nevidence of the identity."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-108",
