      "values:originalText": "(2) An authority for an authorised civilian of a kind covered by\nparagraph 15KC(2)(h) remains in force until the end of the period\nspecified in the authority in accordance with subparagraph\n15KC(2)(h)(iii), unless the authority is cancelled sooner under\nsection 15KE.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) An authority for an authorised civilian of a kind covered by\nparagraph 15KC(2)(h) remains in force until the end of the period\nspecified in the authority in accordance with subparagraph\n15KC(2)(h)(iii), unless the authority is cancelled sooner under\nsection 15KE.",
