      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.122",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Failure to comply with the requirements of this section does not\ninvalidate an authority or anything lawfully done under the\nauthority.",
