    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ko",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15KO Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ko"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.126",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ko-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ko-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8e8c9148ebeb9d54fd0e26780ed2dca6a2d1b1deb9620b125d3c25db5043a0c7"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ko",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KO Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 126,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This section applies if the chief officer of either a law enforcement\nagency or an intelligence agency makes a request under\nsection 15KI or gives a direction under section 15KL to the chief\nofficer of an issuing agency.\n\n(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet."
    },
