          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ko-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9aa1876103b799233b154434dbfbda01a51211b8bf8c811d73f34626787e7c48",
      "skos:note": "Commonwealth must indemnify issuing agency or officer for liability incurred in course of duty."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ko-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KO(2) Indemnity for issuing agencies and officers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 126,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Commonwealth must indemnify the issuing agency, or an\nofficer of the issuing agency, for any liability incurred by the\nagency or officer (including reasonable costs) if:\n\n(a) the liability is incurred because of something done by the\nagency or officer in the course of duty to comply with the\nrequest or direction in the course of duty; and\n\n(b) any requirements prescribed under the regulations have been\nmet."
    },
    {
