      "skos:note": "Reckless disregard for variation or cancellation of authority"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ku-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15KU(3) Effect of being unaware of variation or cancellation of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 128,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, a person is reckless about the\nexistence of the variation or cancellation of an authority or\nauthorisation if:\n\n(a) the person is aware of a substantial risk that the variation or\ncancellation has happened; and\n\n(b) having regard to the circumstances known to the person, it is\nunjustifiable to take the risk that the authority has not been\nvaried or cancelled."
    },
