    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15ma",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MA Meaning of criminal proceeding",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15ma"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.143",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the\nprosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or\noffences.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal\nproceeding:\n\n(a) a bail proceeding;\n\n(b) a committal proceeding;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this Part, criminal proceeding means a proceeding for the\nprosecution, whether summarily or on indictment, of an offence or\noffences.\n\n(2) To avoid doubt, each of the following is part of a criminal\nproceeding:\n\n(a) a bail proceeding;\n\n(b) a committal proceeding;\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
