      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MH(2) Filing and notification",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 149,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The person who files the certificate must give a copy of it to each\nparty to the proceeding at least 14 days (or the shorter period\nagreed to by the party) before the day the operative is to give\nevidence."
    },
