    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mi",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MI Leave for non-compliance",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15mi"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.149",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The person who has filed, or proposes to file, a witness identity\nprotection certificate may apply to the court for leave not to\ncomply with the requirement under subsection 15MH(2) in relation\nto the time within which a copy of the certificate is to be given.\n\n(2) However, the court must not give such leave unless it is satisfied\nthat it was not reasonably practicable to comply with the\nrequirement referred to in subsection (1).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The person who has filed, or proposes to file, a witness identity\nprotection certificate may apply to the court for leave not to\ncomply with the requirement under subsection 15MH(2) in relation\nto the time within which a copy of the certificate is to be given.\n\n(2) However, the court must not give such leave unless it is satisfied\nthat it was not reasonably practicable to comply with the\nrequirement referred to in subsection (1).",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mi-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mi-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9003d4fade234b964f636ebeb6839b29ae2a8e61ea3392596e92dbd101f7c9e5"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15mi",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MI Leave for non-compliance",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 149,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The person who has filed, or proposes to file, a witness identity\nprotection certificate may apply to the court for leave not to\ncomply with the requirement under subsection 15MH(2) in relation\nto the time within which a copy of the certificate is to be given.\n\n(2) However, the court must not give such leave unless it is satisfied\nthat it was not reasonably practicable to comply with the\nrequirement referred to in subsection (1)."
    },
