      "cml:integrityHash": "30f5b43cebb6bc6b5eb4e2f4f8205b37a2206a3902cfbcc96c11c436c6b9e75c",
      "skos:note": "List of parties involved in a proceeding for the purposes of section 146(3)"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-146-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "146(3) Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 150,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of this section, a person involved in a proceeding\nincludes:\n\n(a) the court; and\n\n(b) a party to the proceeding; and\n\n(c) a person given leave to be heard or make submissions in the\nproceeding; and\n\n(d) a lawyer representing a person referred to in paragraph (b) or\n(c) or a lawyer assisting the court in the proceeding; and\n\n(e) any other officer of the court or person assisting the court in\nthe proceeding; and\n\n(f) a person acting in the execution of any process or the\nenforcement of any order in the proceeding.\n15MK  Orders to protect operative’s identity etc."
    },
