      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(a) a witness identity protection certificate for an operative in relation to a proceeding is filed in a court; and (b) there is a jury in the proceeding; and (c) the operative gives evidence.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The witness must provide evidence if the conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mo-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MO(2) Directions to jury",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15mo-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.154",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The court must (unless it considers it inappropriate) direct the jury\nnot to give the operative’s evidence any more or less weight, or\ndraw any adverse inferences against the defendant or another party\nto the proceeding, because:\n\n(a) there is a witness identity protection certificate for the\noperative; or\n\n(b) the court has made an order under section 15MK or\nsubsection 15MM(8), (9) or (10).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The court must (unless it considers it inappropriate) direct the jury\nnot to give the operative’s evidence any more or less weight, or\ndraw any adverse inferences against the defendant or another party\nto the proceeding, because:\n\n(a) there is a witness identity protection certificate for the\noperative; or\n\n(b) the court has made an order under section 15MK or\nsubsection 15MM(8), (9) or (10).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mo"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
