    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mw",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "15MW Recognition of witness identity protection certificates under",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15mw"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "corresponding laws\n\nThe following provisions apply, with any necessary changes, to a\ncorresponding witness identity protection certificate as if it were a\nwitness identity protection certificate given under section 15ME:\n\n(a) section 15MH (filing and notification);\n\n(b) section 15MI (leave for non-compliance);\n\n(c) section 15MJ (effect of witness identity protection\ncertificate);\n\n(d) section 15MK (orders to protect operative’s identity etc.);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "skos:definition": "corresponding laws\n\nThe following provisions apply, with any necessary changes, to a\ncorresponding witness identity protection certificate as if it were a\nwitness identity protection certificate given under section 15ME:\n\n(a) section 15MH (filing and notification);\n\n(b) section 15MI (leave for non-compliance);\n\n(c) section 15MJ (effect of witness identity protection\ncertificate);\n\n(d) section 15MK (orders to protect operative’s identity etc.);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-3-sec-15mw-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "340c51ff9a335f273b80d67a13489878cca8d7dedf60f0d91b74ee297ff5a634",
      "skos:note": "Recognition of witness identity protection certificates under corresponding laws"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-3-sec-15mw",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "15MW Recognition of witness identity protection certificates under",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 159,
      "values:originalText": "corresponding laws\n\nThe following provisions apply, with any necessary changes, to a\ncorresponding witness identity protection certificate as if it were a\nwitness identity protection certificate given under section 15ME:\n\n(a) section 15MH (filing and notification);\n\n(b) section 15MI (leave for non-compliance);\n\n(c) section 15MJ (effect of witness identity protection\ncertificate);\n\n(d) section 15MK (orders to protect operative’s identity etc.);\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nSchedule 3  Amendments relating to controlled operations, assumed identities and\nwitness identity protection"
    },
    {
