      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.173",
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\nassociate, with a criminal organisation or a member of such an\norganisation, includes:\n\n(a) be in the company of the organisation or member; and\n\n(b) communicate with the organisation or member by any means\n(including by post, fax, telephone, or by email or other\nelectronic means).",
      "skos:definition": "Insert:\nassociate, with a criminal organisation or a member of such an\norganisation, includes:\n\n(a) be in the company of the organisation or member; and\n\n(b) communicate with the organisation or member by any means\n(including by post, fax, telephone, or by email or other\nelectronic means).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-14-norm"
        },
        {
