      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "(v) the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of\na power, by a person, court or other body under, or in\nrelation to a matter arising under, an organised crime\ncontrol law of that State; or",
      "skos:definition": "(v) the performance of a function or duty, or the exercise of\na power, by a person, court or other body under, or in\nrelation to a matter arising under, an organised crime\ncontrol law of that State; or",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
