    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-18j",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "18J Application",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-4-sec-18j"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.176",
      "values:originalText": "The Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as\namended by this Division, applies in relation to the communication, use\nand making of a record of information, and the giving of information in\nevidence in proceedings, on or after the commencement of this item,\nwhether the information was obtained before or after that\ncommencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nOther amendments  Schedule 4\nRegulations  Part 3\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010",
      "skos:definition": "The Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as\namended by this Division, applies in relation to the communication, use\nand making of a record of information, and the giving of information in\nevidence in proceedings, on or after the commencement of this item,\nwhether the information was obtained before or after that\ncommencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nOther amendments  Schedule 4\nRegulations  Part 3\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-18j-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "17a834d135437ea1bc5dedb77f99bdc11cc01cd23e2bb050eac9329fcd4709e6",
      "skos:note": "Applicability of amendments to the Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-4-sec-18j",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "18J Application",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 176,
      "values:originalText": "The Telecommunications (Interception and Access) Act 1979, as\namended by this Division, applies in relation to the communication, use\nand making of a record of information, and the giving of information in\nevidence in proceedings, on or after the commencement of this item,\nwhether the information was obtained before or after that\ncommencement.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nOther amendments  Schedule 4\nRegulations  Part 3\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-18j-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-18j"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-19-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 Regulations",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-4-sec-19-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010.pdf, p.177",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters:\n\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n(2)\nIn particular, regulations may be made prescribing matters of a\ntransitional nature (including prescribing any saving or application\nprovisions) relating to the amendments or repeals made by this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\n\nNotes to the  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime)\nAct 2010\n\nTable of Acts\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNotes to the Crimes Legislation Amendment\n(Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNote 1\nThe Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nas shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 3, 2010 amended as indicated\nin the Tables below.\nTable of Acts\nAct\nNumber\nand year\nDate\nof Assent\nDate of\ncommencement\nApplication,\nsaving or\ntransitional\nprovisions\nCrimes Legislation\nAmendment (Serious and\nOrganised Crime) Act\n3, 2010",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters:\n\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n(2)\nIn particular, regulations may be made prescribing matters of a\ntransitional nature (including prescribing any saving or application\nprovisions) relating to the amendments or repeals made by this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\n\nNotes to the  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime)\nAct 2010\n\nTable of Acts\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNotes to the Crimes Legislation Amendment\n(Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNote 1\nThe Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nas shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 3, 2010 amended as indicated\nin the Tables below.\nTable of Acts\nAct\nNumber\nand year\nDate\nof Assent\nDate of\ncommencement\nApplication,\nsaving or\ntransitional\nprovisions\nCrimes Legislation\nAmendment (Serious and\nOrganised Crime) Act\n3, 2010",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-19-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010-sch-4-sec-19-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6266039f16ade8efd46694dc2f55c793f3158d8804c3907c37fefd886c79e5ae",
      "skos:note": "Governor-General may make regulations"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-legislation-amendment-serious-and-organised-crime-act-2010#sch-4-sec-19-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 Regulations",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 177,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe Governor-General may make regulations prescribing matters:\n\n(a) required or permitted by this Act to be prescribed; or\n\n(b) necessary or convenient to be prescribed for carrying out or\ngiving effect to this Act.\n(2)\nIn particular, regulations may be made prescribing matters of a\ntransitional nature (including prescribing any saving or application\nprovisions) relating to the amendments or repeals made by this Act.\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\nComLaw Authoritative Act C2012C00115\n\n\nNotes to the  Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime)\nAct 2010\n\nTable of Acts\n\nCrimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNotes to the Crimes Legislation Amendment\n(Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nNote 1\nThe Crimes Legislation Amendment (Serious and Organised Crime) Act 2010\nas shown in this compilation comprises Act No. 3, 2010 amended as indicated\nin the Tables below.\nTable of Acts\nAct\nNumber\nand year\nDate\nof Assent\nDate of\ncommencement\nApplication,\nsaving or\ntransitional\nprovisions\nCrimes Legislation\nAmendment (Serious and\nOrganised Crime) Act\n3, 2010"
    },
